  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accessing European Markets through E-Commerce</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vietnam&#x2019;s growing e-commerce sector offers new opportunities for small businesses to access international markets. However, women-led businesses often face barriers in digital skills, market knowledge, and compliance with international standards.Building on a successful first phase implemented in 2024&#x2013;2025, this project supports Vietnamese women-led businesses in strengthening their capacity to export to European markets through e-commerce. The project focuses on improving digital skills, enhancing export readiness, and ensuring continued use of e-commerce platforms.Through targeted training, coaching, and matchmaking with European buyers, selected businesses will be supported in converting online visibility into concrete trade opportunities. At the same time, the project strengthens the broader support ecosystem by engaging business support organisations and establishing a network for women entrepreneurs.</narrative>
  </description>
